{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24600","headline":"对酒闲吟赠同老者 · 白居易","name":"对酒闲吟赠同老者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生七十稀，我年幸过之。\n远行将尽路，春梦欲觉时。\n家事口不问，世名心不思。\n老既不足叹，病亦不能治。\n扶持仰婢仆，将养信妻儿。\n饥饱进退食，寒暄加减衣。\n声妓放郑卫，裘马脱轻肥。\n百事尽除去，尚余酒与诗。\n兴来吟一篇，吟罢酒一巵。\n不独适情性，兼用扶衰羸。\n云液洒六腑，阳和生四肢。\n於中我自乐，此外吾不知。\n寄问同老者，舍此将安归。\n莫学蓬心叟，胷中残是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}